<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>StochCraft third-party licences</title>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
  body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 52rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1rem; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; max-height: 24rem; overflow-y: auto; border: 1px solid #8886; padding: 0.75rem; }
  ul.crates { columns: 2 16rem; list-style: none; padding: 0; }
  a { color: LinkText; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>Third-party licences</h1>
<p>StochCraft is licensed under the MIT License or the Apache License 2.0, at your option (see
LICENSE-MIT and LICENSE-APACHE). It is built with the open-source Rust crates listed below.
The list covers every crate that goes into the StochCraft programs and the browser app, for
all the platforms they are built for, with the version used and the licence text.</p>
<p>The fonts the programs and the browser app carry, and the other files that are not Rust
crates, are credited in ATTRIBUTION.md in the project's repository and in StochCraft's About box.</p>

<h2>Licences used</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
  <li>{{name}} ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>

<h2>Licence texts</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<section>
  <h3 id="{{id}}-{{@index}}">{{name}}</h3>
  <p>Used by:</p>
  <ul class="crates">
  {{#each used_by}}
    <li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
  {{/each}}
  </ul>
  <pre>{{text}}</pre>
</section>
{{/each}}
</main>
</body>
</html>
